WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.085
Week 32: Work, Technology, and Formal Communication. summarize a meeting write a professional message explain a technical problem and next action

2
00:00:10.085 --> 00:00:22.732
Form and meaning. Applying the form. Reported speech shifts verb tense back one step (dice → dijo que decía); stressed possessives (el mío, la suya) replace a noun already mentioned.

3
00:00:22.732 --> 00:00:47.945
Model set. Dijo que llegaría tarde. Según ella, el sistema funciona bien. Este archivo es el mío. Esa contraseña es la suya. Además, el plazo se extendió. He/she said that he/she would arrive late. According to her, the system works well. This file is mine. That password is his/hers. Furthermore, the deadline was extended.

4
00:00:47.945 --> 00:00:58.096
Contrastive practice. Change the person, time, number, or level of formality in each model. Preserve the communicative purpose while the grammar changes.

5
00:00:58.096 --> 00:01:11.938
Production check. Say one original sentence for each function: summarize a meeting; write a professional message; explain a technical problem and next action. Then write it and compare the spoken and written forms.

6
00:01:11.938 --> 00:01:37.876
Model language. Dijo que llegaría tarde. — He/she said that he/she would arrive late. Según ella, el sistema funciona bien. — According to her, the system works well. Este archivo es el mío. — This file is mine. Esa contraseña es la suya. — That password is his/hers. Además, el plazo se extendió. — Furthermore, the deadline was extended.

7
00:01:37.876 --> 00:01:47.774
Check your readiness. Explain the core idea. Produce an original example. Complete the section assessment at 85% or higher.
